        {
          "line": 49,
          "text": "DEPENDS_ON **means** the direct Subject Relation Kind from an Atom **to** a canonical Subject entity or instance mentioned **in** its applicable role-specific content or other registered content, other than its GOVERNS target. this reference does **not** make the Atom's content\u2014or every Governing Configuration fact\u2014authoritative about that Subject entity or instance; formal authority depends on the applicable registered content form and role. a formal Claim may be carried in Markdown, structured YAML, or Governing Configuration, but Governing Configuration facts are not automatically Atom Claims."
        },
        {
          "line": 56,
          "text": "mentions **in** Summary, Scope, Claim, Details, other registered body sections, tables, **and** examples count, whether the logical Claim is carried in Markdown, structured YAML, or Governing Configuration. this Relation does **not** establish Workflow control flow **or** execution order; Plan start prerequisites remain separately governed by `BLOCKS` under CA-R-1580-CORE_META_MODEL-DEFINITION--define-plan-blocking."
        }
      ],
